      "writtenOn": "2025-09-30T22:48:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes. I guess so. Note the default lock_timeout is 5000 sec, so 5x or 10x 20s is not too bad actually. Overall, I think it makes sense to leave the lock_timeout by users, if users are ok to wait longer. WDYT?",
      "parentUuid": "af554dd5_72bbab6f",
      "revId": "05ca8c646ac6f807eb0143faebea0ee13192854f",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
